{"id":"6ead27971b185ffe","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimpFace.md","title":"SimpFace","display":"SimpFace","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SimpFace","parameters":["X","R","n","i","a","b"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SimpFace"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>X</span><span>R</span><span>n</span><span>i</span><span>a</span><span>b</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：小拟范畴语义。有序参数：<code>X</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>n</code>、<code>i</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>b</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SimpFace X R n i a b)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists m\n  (exists f\n    (exists h\n      (exists N\n        (and\n          (@ Nat m)\n          (and\n            (@ Succ m n)\n            (and\n              (@ FaceInjection n i f)\n              (and (@ App X n N) (and (in a N) (and (@ SimpRestriction R m n f h) (@ App h a b)))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"58ce9246a7b5fc1b\" href=\"?note=58ce9246a7b5fc1b\" title=\"ZFC_FaceInjection\">FaceInjection</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bf0c84a1c0d1d98b\" href=\"?note=bf0c84a1c0d1d98b\" title=\"ZFC_SimpRestriction\">SimpRestriction</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ SimpFace X R n i a b)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FaceInjection|FaceInjection]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_SimpRestriction|SimpRestriction]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FaceInjection","status":"resolved","id":"58ce9246a7b5fc1b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FaceInjection|FaceInjection]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_SimpRestriction|SimpRestriction]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nat","status":"resolved","id":"e2136a636857d477","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FaceInjection|FaceInjection]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_SimpRestriction|SimpRestriction]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_SimpRestriction","status":"resolved","id":"bf0c84a1c0d1d98b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FaceInjection|FaceInjection]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_SimpRestriction|SimpRestriction]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Succ","stat